caption: Discovery and Permanent Growth
tradition-component: discovery-and-permanent-growth

When the character successfully manifests a legal physical trait through a Power Stunt from one of their Latent Gifts, record the demonstrated build normally. If the character has sufficient earned character points, Spawn immediately permits purchase of a permanent version of that manifested trait.

The permanent version must preserve the same underlying bodily capability and physical special effect. Levels and ordinary numerical strength may differ from the demonstrated version if paid for normally. A new modifier or construction that creates a materially new function requires a new qualifying manifestation unless it merely increases the amount of an already demonstrated function.

Every non-Talent Spawn trait must have both Psionic, -10%, and Super, -10%, under the Eldritch Gifts Universal Origin Rule. The trait must also have a visible, targetable, or otherwise physically meaningful anatomical manifestation appropriate to its function.
